# MBSNM typography

Strictly use the MBSNM typography system.

## Display, headings, and pull quotes — Lora

- Font: **Lora** (`font-display` or semantic `h1`–`h6`, `blockquote`, `.pull-quote`).
- **Sentence case** in copy — not ALL CAPS for headings (eyebrows/labels in Work Sans may stay uppercase when they are UI chrome, not display titles).
- Line height: **1.15–1.25** (tight). Prefer `leading-display` / `leading-tight` / `leading-snug`.

## Body, UI, forms, and signage — Work Sans

- Font: **Work Sans** (`font-sans`, default on `body`).
- **Left-aligned only** — never `text-justify` on prose, forms, or signage.
- Line height: **1.4–1.5**. Prefer `leading-body` / `leading-normal` / `leading-relaxed`.

## Fallbacks (web fonts unavailable)

| Role | Primary | Fallback | Never use |
|------|---------|----------|-----------|
| Display / serif | Lora | Georgia | Times New Roman |
| Body / sans | Work Sans | Arial | Calibri, Comic Sans |

## Implementation

- Fonts load in `src/app/layout.tsx` via `next/font/google`.
- Base stacks and line heights live in `src/app/globals.css` (`@theme` + element defaults).
- Do not add forbidden fonts to SVG `font-family`, CSS stacks, or `@font-face` fallbacks.
